7. Precautions

1. Check all circuit connections before switching on the power supply.
2. Apply the input combinations carefully.
3. Observe the output indicators properly.
4. Record the outputs accurately.

8. Observation

The outputs for all possible input combinations were observed and recorded for the three logic gates.

9. Result

The truth tables of NOR, EX-OR and EX-NOR gates were verified and interpreted successfully.
